*Endpoint:* {{ $json.webhookUrl }}
*Caller IP:* {{ $json.headers['cf-connecting-ip'] || $json.headers['x-real-ip'] || '(unknown)' }}
*What happened:* The caller had the correct key but the signature or timestamp did not verify. No GHL write happened.
*Action Required:* If you were not testing, treat the signing secret as possibly leaked and rotate it.

